msgstr "Une erreur est survenue pendant le stream."

#: src/app/stream/session_worker.c:48
msgid ""
"The PC's virtual display is turned off for this device, so the stream shows "
"the PC's current display."
msgstr ""
"L'écran virtuel du PC est désactivé pour cet appareil : le stream affiche "
"l'écran actuel du PC."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:33
msgid "Controls & shortcuts"
msgstr "Commandes et raccourcis"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:60
msgid ""
"During streaming, use these shortcuts to control Aurora. Scroll with Up/Down "
"or the mouse wheel. Press Back/B/Escape to close this guide."
msgstr ""
"Pendant le streaming, utilisez ces raccourcis pour contrôler Aurora. Faites "
"défiler avec Haut/Bas ou la molette. Appuyez sur Retour/B/Échap pour fermer "
"ce guide."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:62
msgid "TV remote"
msgstr "Télécommande TV"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:63
msgid "Yellow"
msgstr "Jaune"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:63
msgid "Open the stream menu. Press Yellow again to close it."
msgstr ""
"Ouvre le menu du streaming. Appuyez de nouveau sur Jaune pour le fermer."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:64
msgid "Hold Back / press Yellow or Exit"
msgstr "Maintenir Retour / appuyer sur Jaune ou Exit"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:65
msgid ""
"Open the stream menu. A short Back press sends Escape to the PC; holding "
"Back on a Magic Remote sends Exit."
msgstr ""
"Ouvre le menu du streaming. Un appui bref sur Retour envoie Échap au PC ; un "
"appui long sur la Magic Remote envoie Exit."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:66
msgid "Red"
msgstr "Rouge"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:66
msgid "Ask to disconnect. The game keeps running on the PC."
msgstr ""
"Demande s'il faut se déconnecter. Le jeu continue de tourner sur le PC."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:67
msgid "Green"
msgstr "Vert"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:67
msgid "Send the Windows key to the PC (Start menu)."
msgstr "Envoie la touche Windows au PC (menu Démarrer)."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:68
msgid "Blue"
msgstr "Bleu"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:68
msgid "Open the on-screen keyboard. Press Back to close it."
msgstr "Ouvre le clavier à l'écran. Appuyez sur Retour pour le fermer."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:69
msgid "Hold OK (0.6 s), then release"
msgstr "Maintenir OK (0,6 s), puis relâcher"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:69
msgid "Right-click on the PC. A short OK press sends Enter."
msgstr "Effectue un clic droit sur le PC. Un appui bref sur OK envoie Entrée."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:70
msgid "Channel Up / Down"
msgstr "Chaîne + / −"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:70
msgid "Send Page Up / Page Down to the PC."
msgstr "Envoie Page précédente / Page suivante au PC."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:71
msgid ""
"Go to the LG home screen. The stream disconnects and the game keeps running "
"on the PC."
msgstr ""
"Va à l'écran d'accueil LG. Le streaming se déconnecte et le jeu continue de "
"tourner sur le PC."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:72
msgid "Send Numpad 0–9 to the PC."
msgstr "Envoie les touches 0–9 du pavé numérique au PC."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:74 src/app/ui/settings/panes/input.pane.c:88
msgid "Gamepad"
msgstr "Manette"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:75
msgid "LB + RB + Back + Start, then release all"
msgstr "LB + RB + Back + Start, puis tout relâcher"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:75
msgid "Open the stream menu."
msgstr "Ouvre le menu du streaming."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:76
msgid "Hold Select / Back (4 s)"
msgstr "Maintenir Select / Back (4 s)"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:77
msgid ""
"Show or hide pinned performance stats. Hold this button alone; it is also "
"sent to the PC."
msgstr ""
"Affiche ou masque les statistiques de performances épinglées. Maintenez "
"uniquement ce bouton ; il est aussi transmis au PC."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:78
msgid "Y / Triangle with virtual mouse enabled"
msgstr "Y / Triangle avec la souris virtuelle activée"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:78
msgid "Open the on-screen keyboard."
msgstr "Ouvre le clavier à l'écran."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:80 src/app/ui/settings/panes/input.pane.c:97
msgid "Virtual mouse"
msgstr "Souris virtuelle"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:81
msgid ""
"Enable Virtual mouse in the stream menu, or enable it in Settings > Input to "
"start each stream with it."
msgstr ""
"Activez la souris virtuelle dans le menu du streaming, ou dans Paramètres > "
"Entrées pour l'utiliser dès le début de chaque session."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:82
msgid "Right stick / Left stick"
msgstr "Stick droit / gauche"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:82
msgid "Move the pointer / scroll."
msgstr "Déplace le pointeur / fait défiler."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:83
msgid "LT / RT"
msgstr "LT / RT"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:83
msgid "Left-click / right-click."
msgstr "Clic gauche / droit."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:85
msgid "On-screen keyboard"
msgstr "Clavier à l'écran"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:86
msgid "D-pad + A / OK"
msgstr "Croix directionnelle + A / OK"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:86
msgid "Move between keys and press the selected key."
msgstr "Parcourt les touches et appuie sur la touche sélectionnée."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:87
msgid "Y / X / Start"
msgstr "Y / X / Start"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:87
msgid "Space / Backspace / Enter (standard gamepad layout)."
msgstr "Espace / Retour arrière / Entrée (disposition standard d'une manette)."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:88
msgid "LT / LB / RB"
msgstr "LT / LB / RB"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:88
msgid "Switch letters and symbols / move the text cursor left / right."
msgstr ""
"Bascule entre lettres et symboles / déplace le curseur de texte à gauche / à "
"droite."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:89
msgid "B / Back"
msgstr "B / Back"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:89
msgid "Close the keyboard. Gamepad B also sends Escape to the PC."
msgstr "Ferme le clavier. Le bouton B de la manette envoie aussi Échap au PC."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:91
msgid "Leaving a stream"
msgstr "Quitter un stream"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:92
#: src/app/ui/streaming/streaming.controller.c:783
#: src/app/ui/streaming/streaming.view.c:154
msgid "Disconnect"
msgstr "Déconnecter"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:92
msgid ""
"Return to Aurora and leave the application running on the PC so you can "
"resume later."
msgstr ""
"Revient à Aurora en laissant l'application ouverte sur le PC pour la "
"reprendre plus tard."

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:93
#: src/app/ui/streaming/streaming.controller.c:728
#: src/app/ui/streaming/streaming.view.c:164
msgid "End session"
msgstr "Terminer la session"

#: src/app/ui/help/help.dialog.c:93
msgid ""
"Ask the host to close the application after confirmation. Not available for "
"Remote Monitor / Remote Input streams."
msgstr ""
"Demande à l'hôte de fermer l'application après confirmation. Indisponible "
"pour les streams Remote Monitor / Remote Input."

